#, fuzzy
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Seguridad"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "If the xref:security-overview.adoc[Quarkus Security extension] is present and CDI request context is active, the `SecurityIdentity` of the emitting thread is automatically propagated to each receiver invocation."
msgstr "Si está presente la xref:security-overview.adoc[extensión Quarkus Security] y el contexto de solicitud CDI está activo, la `SecurityIdentity` del hilo emisor se propaga automáticamente a cada invocación del receptor."

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
